100% Orange Juice, which is a japanese doujin party game in a Mario Party sense, just with more balanced comeback options? I'd love to see you battle HoloMyth in it! :heart_suit:"},{"t":27880,"who":"@Mavjin8","id":"UCd9uXwjIbv9zhd_oy_Scoww","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":20,"c":4294278144,"m":"To think this could have been 7 hours of resetting for a shiny Ditto. Btw did you know Nintendo sells an N64 controller to use for the N64 Switch Online games? Perfect way to play Mario 64, Zelda OoT/MM, or Star Fox 64. "},{"t":27901,"who":"@victorxy0104","id":"UCnkZvDY1Mb0yw65cXCNZuPQ","k":"milestone","tier":"Gemlins","m":"Member for 10 months"},{"t":27989,"who":"@cyberyurei","id":"UCrSwUl1rC-pg1odVSll0IBw","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"Super Mario 64 is one of the few games I could play back then, it's amazing how most things from it hold up today, can't wait for when you play it (I can), did you see something for Mario Day in JP?"},{"t":28542,"who":"@HC-49","id":"UCAP5lICYNgz_TZc4p8-hA5Q","k":"sc","cur":"CA$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"How good are you identifying a pokemon by its name? A pharmaceutical professor once tested his students to determine whether the name is a drug or a pokemon. It's been around if you saw?"},{"t":28556,"who":"@cyberyurei","id":"UCrSwUl1rC-pg1odVSll0IBw","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"Oh yeah, the Kyogre thing may be a misunderstanding of the Kansai-ben and how to translate it, since it's a southern dialect and probably what they used for him, kinda like Sans sounding rural in JP"},{"t":28580,"who":"@yuuuufaaaaa","id":"UCwKMIK-2eOzeJkyAKriR0YA","k":"member","tier":"Welcome to Gemlins!","m":""},{"t":28648,"who":"@Generix90","id":"UC23Hod3XIhISe6r82pRZs4g","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":5,"c":4280150454,"m":"Bless you! :_bijouPat:"},{"t":28796,"who":"@Evilriku13","id":"UCr8XG2bZljPeIeG6nn8znCw","k":"sc","cur":"€","amt":11.11,"c":4294953512,"m":"To teach you a german counter attack in a non verbal way against Kiara: \"Four-arch meech niche'd!\" or \"Verarsch mich nicht!\" which means \"don't troll me!\" in german. Ask Kiara it's common saying there"},{"t":28943,"who":"@BladeFlower剣の花","id":"UC9CRrztlH310H9PosO1ICeQ","k":"sc","cur":"BOB","amt":50,"c":4294953512,"m":"Oh princess, I'm curious, what's your favorite mermelade? myah I love all sweets, they're my addiction, but I try to eat a lot. "},{"t":28963,"who":"@Tomgetic","id":"UCeXXfq17ZMTEm4u2Yu5_zcw","k":"sc","cur":"€","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"I used to have a lot of nightmares, but one day it just kinda stopped. It's been more than a decade now"},{"t":28963,"who":"@akshaynd95","id":"UCkkEcb5asSfZVunLHBG5LmA","k":"sc","cur":"₹","amt":200,"c":4294953512,"m":"Forgive me Biboo, for I have sinned. I have been going to my swimming pool for 3 years now, and have just now realized that I have been swimming between the lanes marked '6' and '7' the entire time."},{"t":28995,"who":"@cyberyurei","id":"UCrSwUl1rC-pg1odVSll0IBw","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"I don't remember when my last nightmare was, but I never got so scared as to wake up from them since I used to have lucid dreams, despite having also vivid dreams, maybe falling off a cliff "},{"t":28998,"who":"@HC-49","id":"UCAP5lICYNgz_TZc4p8-hA5Q","k":"sc","cur":"CA$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"Speaking of CC. Two funny German insults you can learn then ask her and/or Kiwawa: Hodenkobold which means ball goblin and Klotaucher which means toilet diver. They should be suitable for you to use."},{"t":29165,"who":"@D4_000-4","id":"UC1xsNwZtIQopdOW5vrWyOOw","k":"sc","cur":"₱","amt":250,"c":4294953512,"m":"My powers are fading, I don't know all the Gen 8 onwards pokemon names off the top of my head :_bijouPebblecry:"},{"t":29214,"who":"@Mavjin8","id":"UCd9uXwjIbv9zhd_oy_Scoww","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"On the topic of games you once talked about wanting to play, and certain days of the year. \"Rockman Day\" is June 9th. Yes, actually. "},{"t":29269,"who":"@HC-49","id":"UCAP5lICYNgz_TZc4p8-hA5Q","k":"sc","cur":"CA$","amt":20,"c":4294278144,"m":"Have you heard the song I don't wanna get out of futon by 打首獄門同好会 (Uchikubi Gokumon Doukoukai)? It's about not wanting to get up in the morning due to being cold. There are death growl vocals in the song you can do in JP."},{"t":29339,"who":"@Evilriku13","id":"UCr8XG2bZljPeIeG6nn8znCw","k":"sc","cur":"€","amt":5,"c":4280150454,"m":"Apfelkuchen = Apple Pie in german.There are also Pferdeäpfel, but don't say that out loud, as it's.. horse dung basically. Dunno why it's like that."},{"t":29502,"who":"@Evilriku13","id":"UCr8XG2bZljPeIeG6nn8znCw","k":"sc","cur":"€","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"But for the real german teaser: Ask Kiara or Cecilia if they like the Pokemon \"Unratütox\", and yes, that's the german name off one of the german Pokemon, which is widely disliked for it's design! xD"},{"t":29698,"who":"@HC-49","id":"UCAP5lICYNgz_TZc4p8-hA5Q","k":"sc","cur":"CA$","amt":20,"c":4294278144,"m":"Do you know Fiveish or aka Yap Dollar on Tik Tok/Instagram from various accounts? One of my sisters showed me and it's full of unhinged brainrot... I like the Boeing 737-200 landing one lol. All I can say is Xiaohongshuuuuu!"},{"t":29726,"who":"@cyberyurei","id":"UCrSwUl1rC-pg1odVSll0IBw","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"I almost drowned in a pool as well when younger, I was always small so I had a rough time going to the deeper parts of the public pools. P.S.: Nightmares can be induced by what you eat btw."},{"t":29732,"who":"@BladeFlower剣の花","id":"UC9CRrztlH310H9PosO1ICeQ","k":"sc","cur":"BOB","amt":50,"c":4294953512,"m":"In my lucid dreams I'm a different person with different stories, it's weird, isn't it?"},{"t":29766,"who":"@HC-49","id":"UCAP5lICYNgz_TZc4p8-hA5Q","k":"sc","cur":"CA$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"Here is a nice and easy math problem to solve: 6+9×6+9=?"},{"t":29823,"who":"@Generix90","id":"UC23Hod3XIhISe6r82pRZs4g","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":50,"